@startuml
title DEV settings: verified identity, private photo and reminder consent
actor Learner
participant Web
participant Gateway
participant Core
participant Provider
participant Product
database DB
participant Worker
Learner -> Web: Open account settings
Web -> Gateway: GET auth/methods (current session)
Gateway -> Core: Allowlisted request and public application key
Core -> DB: Read scoped OAuth identities/password credential
Core --> Web: Google / Facebook / Email connected + available
opt Explicit OAuth linking
  Learner -> Provider: Provider consent
  Provider --> Web: Credential
  Web -> Core: POST auth/methods/google or facebook
  Core -> Provider: Verify credential and audience
  Core -> DB: Lock current user; same verified email; reject foreign identity
  Core --> Web: Updated methods; unchanged session/account
end
Learner -> Web: Select photo, preview, Save
Web -> Web: Decode, crop, strip metadata, bound JPEG
Web -> Product: PATCH profile with bounded image/name
Product -> Core: Authenticate session
Product -> DB: Scoped profile update
Product --> Web: Persisted profile and header avatar
Learner -> Web: Choose channel consent, days, minute, quiet hours; Save
opt Newly enabled Push
  Web -> Learner: Browser permission
  Web -> Product: Register browser subscription
end
Web -> Product: PATCH changed notification preferences
Product -> DB: Preserve omitted fields and verified recipient
loop Every minute
  Worker -> DB: Check timezone, day, due activity, consent, quiet window
  Worker -> DB: Enqueue unique occurrence; claim lease; recheck consent
  Worker -> Provider: Email or Web Push when configured
  Worker -> DB: Record sent / failed / uncertain / suppressed
end
@enduml
